      <data key="d2">cb-0474</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BLACK CATS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Black Cats is a nickname for Sunderland A.F.C., reflecting the color of their kit."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0474</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PASSION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Passion refers to the fan base's enthusiasm for Sunderland A.F.C., which is mentioned as a factor in Atamalyan's decision to join."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0474</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RICH HISTORY&quot;">
